---
title: Test - View Markdown Artifact Assertions
---
sequenceDiagram
    actor Dev as Developer
    participant CP as Content Panel
    participant Store as Session Store
    participant HTTP as Artifact Client
    participant API as Artifact API (Server)
    participant MD as Markdown Renderer

    Dev->>CP: Clicks .md artifact (from list or chat ref)
    CP->>Store: Read selectedArtifact
    Store-->>CP: ArtifactRef (path, label)
    Note right of Store: assert selectedArtifact is not null
    Note right of Store: assert path ends with .md

    CP->>HTTP: fetchArtifact(path)
    HTTP->>API: GET /artifacts/{path}
    API-->>HTTP: Raw markdown content
    Note right of API: assert response status 200
    Note right of API: assert response body is non-empty string

    HTTP-->>CP: string (markdown)
    CP->>MD: Render markdown content
    MD-->>CP: HTML output
    Note right of MD: assert output is valid HTML
    Note right of MD: assert headings, lists, code blocks rendered

    CP->>Dev: Display rendered markdown
    Note right of CP: assert content panel shows rendered HTML, not raw markdown
    Note right of CP: assert file path shown in content header
